  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Discover a beautifully transformed 1950s residence, freshly renovated for modern living, where every detail speaks to comfort, character, and endless possibility.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find three inviting bedrooms designed to nurture rest and relaxation. A spacious separate lounge is perfect for family gatherings or quiet evenings, while the sunlit kitchen and dining area invite laughter and connection. Enjoy the convenience of a modern bathroom and a separate toilet, thoughtfully planned for busy mornings.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a double garage provides secure parking for two vehicles and ample storage. The versatile basement and dedicated study open the door to creativity, productivity, or the ultimate hobby space.\r\n\r\nSet in the heart of a vibrant community, this home is zoned for sought-after schools including Forrest Hill Primary and Takapuna Normal Intermediate. Walk to Westlake Girls, and let your ambitions soar with Westlake Boys’just across the street—education excellence is at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nEnjoy effortless access to Wairau Park’s shops and restaurants, North Shore Hospital, Smales Farm’s transport hub, and stunning local beaches. Swift motorway connections put the entire North Shore and Auckland City within easy reach, ensuring your daily commute is as seamless as your weekends are exciting.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re upsizing, downsizing, or investing for the future, this stunningly renovated home offers a lifestyle of comfort and convenience in a welcoming community.\r\n\r\nDon’t miss your chance to secure this North Shore gem—call today to arrange your\r\nprivate viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
